{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"13b328ca9c493d84f941821285a7ca1a50648da82eccc2da174a5ae22489eb30","ja":"ヒーローを待ちわびて","zh":"翘首等待英雄","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"51cdd2c03002e51577cf72a365f0b0a1507fbe439d63b50538696dd60b1a06cb","ja":"ヒーローショーが始まるまでの間、\n百合子は瑞希に、熱い解説を続けていて……","zh":"在英雄秀开始前的这段时间里，\n百合子一直在热情地给瑞希讲解……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cb41fd28985e6be00ce51778ea4769c74b93dca6ee3c373ec4ef184c8024d381","ja":"あとはエターナルフォレスト、ディープスカーレット。\nこのあたりが、人気のある合体技ですね。","zh":"还有永恒森林、深红之痕。\n这几招都是很受欢迎的合体技能呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"152e15691338920fa74ea0e08cbbb70e7d6674ccd2344d0637f4527bb9d5d57c","ja":"なるほど、ありがとうございます。\n……とても勉強になったぞ。","zh":"原来如此，非常感谢。\n……真是受益匪浅呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"98967546ab86ed921dd04eb3be6102470727d6e886b47478963fa96ee3ad30eb","ja":"「おねーちゃん、すっごくよくしってるね！」\n「すごいすご～い！」","zh":"“大姐姐，你知道得好多呀！”\n“好厉害好厉害～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"42f2d7367f71bd3eb6abb24b1e4660413db7683c95141d4274406f0b211b3b53","ja":"えっ！？　あっ、ありがとう……！？\nえっと……。","zh":"咦！？啊，谢谢……！？\n那个……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6e1cd1d868bd5b4b529e0ab4121740076347fd55e17f7e2d01579d883e053979","ja":"はい。このお姉さんは、\n今日来てくれるヒーローが大好きなのです。","zh":"是的。这位大姐姐\n最喜欢今天会来的英雄了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e9ed36b13993590f49cadebbf33a409d20cab88bbf1c7258d5782b4535bfecd4","ja":"「ボクも大好き～！」「ねぇねぇ。このまえ、\nイエローがレッドにダメって言ってたけど、なんで？」","zh":"「我也最喜欢了～！」「呐呐。上次\n黄战士对红战士说不行，是为什么呀？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6619dc6c74207de23d31176cdda53921d099a25beacd6f2248b220ce8f6f69b5","ja":"あ……それはね。イエローが止めたのは、\nレッドが危なかったからで……。","zh":"啊……那个啊。黄色之所以阻止，\n是因为红色当时很危险……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b166d0e5c7389d2e52fb6dab5e2639560c9ec2156a0a747bc82e6907ba1ca2c5","ja":"「へぇ～、そうなんだ！」「ねえ、そっちの\nおねえちゃんは、どんな技が好きなの？」","zh":"“诶～，这样啊！”“呐，那边的\n大姐姐，你喜欢什么招式呢？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"991b3a593f330eeed710180987ba0e064a3d31922a7b7e86d55eee8e0ad2a1f9","ja":"ディープスカーレットです。技を出すときの、\nピンクのポーズが好きです。……しゃきーん。","zh":"这是深绯（Deep Scarlet）。使出必杀技时\n粉红色的姿势很让人喜欢。……唰——","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f4b2bf6216adb7f328c3424f005d9d56e9ff34c6ffaaa641e6adae8430d25a94","ja":"子どもたちとの会話に盛り上がるふたりだったが、\n数十分後、会場に不穏な空気が漂い始めて……","zh":"两人和孩子们聊得正起劲，\n几十分钟后，会场里却开始弥漫起不安的气氛……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"99569d60bbbdcef23928b1b22212a63b0dd9f0677d281bfc18518715fc4570bf","ja":"「ねえねえ、ショー、まだ始まらないの？」","zh":"“呐呐，表演还没开始吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"3e7856d9ab7af34d3bf87b3c358c4f2b1c73f03ec6be355304a9bf8602f17001","ja":"開演時間は、だいぶすぎてますね。\n……なにかあったのでしょうか？","zh":"开演时间已经过了很久了呢。\n……是发生什么事了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"53bf8a2428f937c51e3e67d7b240ccd1b6c10701fd68cb06719d3c065b1b0614","ja":"そうですね……どうしたんでしょう？\n……あっ、アナウンスが……。","zh":"是啊……怎么回事呢？\n……啊，有广播……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"3125fd105b3e98f4d817629757dc826308d307454fada4198c785daaa7404f82","ja":"「ただ今、トラブルのため開演を見合わせております。\n大変申し訳ございませんが、開演時間は未定で……」","zh":"“目前由于突发状况，演出暂停开场。\n非常抱歉，具体开场时间尚未确定……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c6d02534b785b99f699e70f39e0b86ea1ee867cfeb754226973a2fe17506e943","ja":"「ええ～～～っ！？」「ねえねえ、おねえちゃん。\nまだまつの～！」「早くレッドにあいたいよ～！」","zh":"「诶诶～～～！？」「呐呐，姐姐。\n还要等多久嘛～！」「好想快点见到红战士哦～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1682.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a8527fb0d08bb0727012d4a54b9d0889b707393f32d312fc52b5f35fd2260204","ja":"う～ん……。瑞希さん、\n私たちでなにかできないでしょうか……？","zh":"嗯……瑞希小姐，\n有没有什么事情是我们能做到的呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
